    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d430">

                <pb facs="0475" n="303" sameAs="frus:frus1917Supp01v01/pg303"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72119/657</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Argentina</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Stimson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Buenos Aires</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-06-23T00:00:00-04:16">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 23, 1917, 12 a.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received 3.25 p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>My April 25, 11 a.m.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d430-f1"/> I am reliably informed that
                    congress of neutrals will be called for August 15. <hi rendition="#italic">La
                        Prensa</hi> to-day says that the principal matters of the program of the
                    conference will be announced soon and that Bolivia, Brazil, Colombia, Chile,
                    Mexico, Paraguay, Peru, Uruguay, Ecuador, Haiti, and the five Central American
                    States adhered to the initiative but since their so answering Argentina, Haiti
                    [omission]; that only United States of America, Cuba, and Panama did not agree
                    to the idea, who have also declared war, Dominica, which has broken relations
                    with Germany, and Venezuela.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
